        "valueString": "Denies shortness of breath, orthopnoea, paroxysmal nocturnal dyspnoea, chest pain, palpitations, syncope, acute shortness of breath, cough, or wheeze. Uses one pillow. Speaking in full sentences on the phone with no audible shortness of breath."
